  expr_conversion_err_argument.pcpp - break step of expr_conversion.pcpp:
  an int32 argument for an int8 parameter (SM0404)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\expr_conversion_err_argument.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\expr_conversion_err_argument.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
